{
  "name": "Agency OS 04 \u00b7 Client Onboarding Autopilot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Client Onboarding Autopilot\nWhen a deal closes, the AM submits one form. Then:\n1. Creates the client's **Google Drive folder** and a **Slack channel**.\n2. **Brain (product-marketing)** writes the client's positioning and ICP context doc, saved to Drive. Every later AI step can reuse it.\n3. **Brain (marketing-plan)** builds a 90-day plan with a north-star metric, goals, phases and quick wins.\n4. Registers the client in **Clients**, emails a branded welcome and kickoff plan, and posts the plan in Slack.\n5. After **3 days**, reminds the AM to confirm access (GA4, ad accounts, CMS) and that the kickoff happened.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b1de0404-cadb-46fa-8397-4790aeb486fa",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "New client signed",
        "formDescription": "Internal: starts onboarding automatically.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Client name",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Website",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Primary contact name",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Primary contact email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Account manager email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Services",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "multiselect": true,
              "requiredField": true,
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "SEO"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Paid Ads"
                  },
